msgstr "復原到提問時的 checkpoint，之後的改動作廢，由你重新回答。"

msgid "Roughly 4k token. This answer lands in the transcript, and every remaining turn in the session re-reads it—so a generous answer keeps billing long after the question is answered."
msgstr "約等於 4k token。這個答案會落進 transcript，而 transcript 這個工作階段剩下的每一輪都要重讀一遍——所以慷慨的答案在問題被回答完很久之後還在收費。"

msgid "Routine watchdog"
msgstr "例行巡檢"

msgid "Run brew install uv. opensandbox-server is a Python package, so without uv there is nothing to start."
msgstr "跑 brew install uv。opensandbox-server 是個 Python 包，沒有 uv 就沒東西可起。"

msgid "Run claude setup-token in the container"
msgstr "容器裡跑 claude setup-token"

msgid "Run docker build -f docker/agent.Dockerfile -t {image} . — an image with no registry prefix can only be built locally."
msgstr "跑 docker build -f docker/agent.Dockerfile -t {image} . —— 不帶 registry 前綴的映像只能在本機建置。"

msgid "Run docker pull opensandbox/egress:v1.1.6, then point [egress] image at it. v1.1.4 403s every scoped package as soon as a credential is bound."
msgstr "跑 docker pull opensandbox/egress:v1.1.6，然後把 [egress] image 指過去。v1.1.4 一旦綁上憑證，每個 scoped 包都會 403。"

msgid "Run one turn"
msgstr "跑一輪"

msgid "Run tests"
msgstr "跑測試"

msgid "Run the official CLI's login once in the tool container; store the credential here. No setup needed locally. Official accounts only; custom gateways use API key."
msgstr "在工具容器裡跑一次官方 CLI 的登入，拿到的憑證存在這兒。本機什麼都不用裝。僅限官方帳號；自建閘道走 API key。"

msgid "Run top-to-bottom; drag to reorder"
msgstr "從上往下跑，拖著改順序"

msgid "Run uvx opensandbox-server --config ~/.sandbox.toml listening on {server}, with [egress] mode = \"dns+nft\"."
msgstr "跑 uvx opensandbox-server --config ~/.sandbox.toml，監聽 {server}，並且 [egress] mode = \"dns+nft\"。"

msgid "Run uvx opensandbox-server on the host, not here: this orchestrator is inside a container and the sandbox server needs the host's docker. Then point ORCH_SANDBOX_SERVER at it — host.docker.internal:8080 on Docker Desktop, the host IP or --network host on Linux."
msgstr "在宿主機上跑 uvx opensandbox-server，別在這兒跑：這個 orchestrator 在容器裡，而沙箱伺服器要用宿主機的 docker。然後把 ORCH_SANDBOX_SERVER 指過去 —— Docker Desktop 上是 host.docker.internal:8080，Linux 上用宿主機 IP 或 --network host。"

