msgstr "S{seq}：{n, plural, other {# 條}}已驗收的 QA 流程仍然通過"

msgid "S{seq}: the discrimination check restored the worktree and git still reports changes. Nothing should be committed from this branch until you have looked at it."
msgstr "S{seq}：區分力檢查還原工作區之後，git 仍然報告有改動。在你看過之前，不要從這個分支提交任何東西。"

msgid "S{seq}: the new tests fail without the change, as they should"
msgstr "S{seq}：新測試在沒有這次改動時會失敗，正該如此"

msgid "S{seq}: the new tests still pass with the change reverted"
msgstr "S{seq}：把改動還原之後，新測試仍然通過"

msgid "S{seq}: the tests hold, but nothing covers {files}"
msgstr "S{seq}：測試立得住，但沒有任何東西覆蓋 {files}"

msgid "S{seq}: worktree dirty after a check"
msgstr "S{seq}：一次檢查之後工作區不乾淨"

