msgid "Set [server] api_key = \"…\" in the server's TOML, restart it, then Settings → Sandbox server → Read from server. The containers hold the checkout, the mailbox token and the CLI logins."
msgstr "在伺服器的 TOML 裡設 [server] api_key = \"…\"，重啟它，然後 設定 → 沙箱伺服器 → 從伺服器讀取。容器裡放著檢出的程式碼、信箱 token 和各個 CLI 的登入。"

