msgstr "從這個分支開"

msgid "Started"
msgstr "起來了"

msgid "Started at"
msgstr "開始時間"

msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "起中…"

msgid "Starts after approval"
msgstr "批了才開工"

msgid "Step {nth}"
msgstr "第 {nth} 級"

msgid "Steps one turn may take before it is cut off. Most turns finish in about 36; the long tail is an agent lost rather than working, and it costs the most because every step re-reads the transcript. Changing it restarts every session."
msgstr "一個 turn 最多走多少步就掐斷。多數 turn 三十幾步就完事；長尾是 agent 迷路了而不是在幹活，而且最貴——每一步都要重讀整份記錄。改這一項會重啟所有 session。"

msgid "still not up after {secs}s"
msgstr "等了 {secs} 秒還沒起來"

