msgstr "不再禁止 {d}"

msgid "Stop dispatching; branch is kept but not merged. A retrospective is still required."
msgstr "停止派發，分支保留不合入，仍然要寫 retro"

msgid "Stop here (archive)"
msgstr "就停在這裡（封存）"

